Rev 7:1 , An angel seals the servants of God in their foreheads;
Rev 7:4 , The number of them that were sealed. of the tribes of Israel a certain number;
Rev 7:9 , Of all the other nations an innumerable multitude, which stand before the throne, clad in white robes, and palms in their hands;
Rev 7:14 , Their robes were washed in the blood of the Lamb.
